# Pocket Goblin visual identity

## Character

Official mascot only:

- `public/assets/branding/goblin-original.png` (source)
- `public/assets/branding/goblin-mascot.webp` (+ PNG fallback) for UI

Use `GoblinMascot` **only** in the Den welcome area. Do not repeat the character across screens. Do not use asset sheets, extra poses, decorative woodland illustrations, emoji, or CSS stand-ins.

## Interface tone

Premium, modern, calm life-management — not a fantasy game or children’s app.

The mascot provides whimsy; the UI provides peace.

## Palette

| Role | Direction |
|------|-----------|
| Primary | Deep forest green |
| Secondary | Soft sage |
| Background | Warm off-white |
| Cards | White / pale cream |
| Text | Dark charcoal |
| Borders | Subtle warm grey |
| Accent | Muted amber, sparingly |

Avoid busy gradients, illustrated chrome, leaves/mushrooms/sparkles, and excessive imagery.
